<title>CHILE: Chilgener 1996 net falls 15 percent.</title>
<headline>Chilgener 1996 net falls 15 percent.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean power utility Chilgener reported profits of 41.86 billion pesos, down 15 percent on 1995, said electricity manager Jose Pedro Undurraga.</p>
<p>The firm's operating earnings rose 17 percent to 43.77 billion pesos in 1996, Undurraga told a news conference.</p>
